    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2763050/extras/a2b772260e2ed0f6f935544173bedf53.avif?t=1749412132\" width=600 height=194 /></span><br><br>Welcome to the <strong>Goat's Tale Adventure</strong>! It's an engaging precision platformer whose predecessors gained recognition from over <strong>several thousand players on the Steam</strong>. Now, we invite you to an entirely new experience with our new heroine taking the lead!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Overview</h2><strong>Enhanced Physics and New Code</strong><br><br>Taking into account feedback from the previous two parts, we decided to thoroughly rebuild the game's physics to make it more precise. Now, the heroine moves with significantly improved agility, and the gameplay dynamics have gained a new dimension thanks to the game code written from scratch.<br><br><strong>New Mechanics</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2763050/extras/02a216e90747242b74766d8eac1a7e6f.poster.avif?t=1749412132\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2763050/extras/02a216e90747242b74766d8eac1a7e6f.webm?t=1749412132\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2763050/extras/02a216e90747242b74766d8eac1a7e6f.mp4?t=1749412132\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Changing the main character (we'll see you soon, courier), we focused on introducing unique abilities that highlight her uniqueness. Our heroine, Bouba, has mastered the art of controlling water. Now, every waterfall becomes an elevator for her, allowing her to overcome obstacles and reach even greater heights.<br><br><strong>World Exploration</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2763050/extras/f14cf06a8f793de6af4175194d658570.poster.avif?t=1749412132\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2763050/extras/f14cf06a8f793de6af4175194d658570.webm?t=1749412132\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2763050/extras/f14cf06a8f793de6af4175194d658570.mp4?t=1749412132\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>In <strong>Goat's Tale Adventure</strong>, every level holds treasures to collect, and before them stand powerful monsters ready to be defeated by our heroine.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Goat's Tale Adventure offers:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> <strong>A challenge for the most demanding players.</strong><br></li><li> <strong>A completely new adventure led by the heroine.</strong><br></li><li> <strong>Even more captivating gameplay.</strong><br></li><li> <strong>Wonderful music.</strong><br></li><li> <strong>New, innovative mechanics tailored to the heroine's abilities.</strong><br></li><li> <strong>Beautiful, pixel art graphics.</strong></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2763050/extras/a2b772260e2ed0f6f935544173bedf53.avif?t=1749412132\" width=600 height=194 /></span><br><br>Welcome to the <strong>Goat's Tale Adventure</strong>! It's an engaging precision platformer whose predecessors gained recognition from over <strong>several thousand players on the Steam</strong>. Now, we invite you to an entirely new experience with our new heroine taking the lead!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Overview</h2><strong>Enhanced Physics and New Code</strong><br><br>Taking into account feedback from the previous two parts, we decided to thoroughly rebuild the game's physics to make it more precise. Now, the heroine moves with significantly improved agility, and the gameplay dynamics have gained a new dimension thanks to the game code written from scratch.<br><br><strong>New Mechanics</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2763050/extras/02a216e90747242b74766d8eac1a7e6f.poster.avif?t=1749412132\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2763050/extras/02a216e90747242b74766d8eac1a7e6f.webm?t=1749412132\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2763050/extras/02a216e90747242b74766d8eac1a7e6f.mp4?t=1749412132\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Changing the main character (we'll see you soon, courier), we focused on introducing unique abilities that highlight her uniqueness. Our heroine, Bouba, has mastered the art of controlling water. Now, every waterfall becomes an elevator for her, allowing her to overcome obstacles and reach even greater heights.<br><br><strong>World Exploration</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2763050/extras/f14cf06a8f793de6af4175194d658570.poster.avif?t=1749412132\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2763050/extras/f14cf06a8f793de6af4175194d658570.webm?t=1749412132\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2763050/extras/f14cf06a8f793de6af4175194d658570.mp4?t=1749412132\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>In <strong>Goat's Tale Adventure</strong>, every level holds treasures to collect, and before them stand powerful monsters ready to be defeated by our heroine.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Goat's Tale Adventure offers:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> <strong>A challenge for the most demanding players.</strong><br></li><li> <strong>A completely new adventure led by the heroine.</strong><br></li><li> <strong>Even more captivating gameplay.</strong><br></li><li> <strong>Wonderful music.</strong><br></li><li> <strong>New, innovative mechanics tailored to the heroine's abilities.</strong><br></li><li> <strong>Beautiful, pixel art graphics.</strong></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Step into the shoes of the new heroine and pursue the treasures in this exceptionally demanding adventure. Explore lands where only the most resilient players will reach the summit.",
